                                 "Come back to the app: the check updates by itself."], place: .noScooter),
        "a1": CheckGuide(proves: "The cloud-built app installs and starts on your iPhone.",
                         steps: ["Install the .ipa with SideStore.", "Open CorckieApp once."], place: .noScooter),
        "a2": CheckGuide(proves: "The Home Screen shows the right name and the scooter icon.",
