                         steps: ["Same recording as c3."], place: .scooterHome),
        "c5": CheckGuide(proves: "After a phone restart, the scooter still wakes the app before you open it.",
                         steps: ["Scooter off.", "Restart the phone.", "Unlock once, but don't open CorckieApp.",
                                 "Switch the scooter on.", "Wait 30 s, then open the app."], place: .scooterHome),
        "c6": CheckGuide(proves: "The app can notify you when the scooter wakes it (the \"Going for a ride?\" chain).",
                         steps: ["Go to the Home Screen and lock the phone, then turn the scooter on.",
                                 "Before that, once: allow notifications (Permissions, step 1) and switch the scooter off.",
                                 "A \"Scooter on · …%\" / \"Going for a ride? Tap here\" notification arrives within ~30 s; tap it."], place: .scooterHome),
        "c6b": CheckGuide(proves: "The notification plays the Kick-off chime you chose.",
