                                  "Did you hear the Kick-off chime with the notification?", "Tap Pass or Fail."], place: .scooterHome),
        "c6d": CheckGuide(proves: "The \"Going for a ride?\" notification does not stay around after the scooter is off.",
                          steps: ["Do the c6 steps until the notification is on the lock screen.",
                                  "Switch the scooter off (or leave it ~5 minutes until it switches itself off).",
                                  "Wait up to 2 minutes with the phone locked. Did the notification go? If it is still there, open the app: it must go then.",
                                  "Tap Pass if it went by itself or when you opened the app; Fail if it stayed (add a Note which)."], place: .scooterHome),
        "c7": CheckGuide(proves: "The wake-up and recording also work in Low Power Mode.",
