        "u6": CheckGuide(proves: "The safety rules of the live ride screen and the message limits work: SLOW above 45 km/h and off below 43, GPS speed always labelled, banners can't be tapped while moving, at most 2 messages at ride start, hot once, very hot until it cools, one \"Going for a ride?\" per power-on.",
                         steps: ["Developer → Checks → Run all automatic (it runs this check in a second).",
