                         steps: ["Developer → Checks → Run all automatic (it runs this check in a second).",
                                 "Result: a list of ticks, one per rule, and how many log rows were written."], place: .noScooter),
        "d7": CheckGuide(proves: "When the scooter drops mid-ride, the phone takes over (GPS speed) and totals stay scooter-only.",
